  BackstoryTemplates:
  - Once a {role} of the old kingdom, {name} has spent years searching for {item}.
  - '{name} was driven from their homeland by {enemy} and now seeks revenge.'
  - A former {role}, {name} guards the {location} with unwavering dedication.
  - '{name} discovered the secrets of {location} long ago and has never left.'
  EnemyNames:
  - Shadow Guardian
  - Stone Golem
  - Wraith
  - Cave Troll
  - Dark Sentinel
  ItemNames:
  - Ancient Tome
  - Crystal Shard
  - Golden Idol
  - Runic Key
  - Sacred Relic
  LocationNames:
  - Crypt
  - Sanctum
  - Chamber
  - Library
  - Vault
  - Hall of Echoes
  QuestNameTemplates:
  - The Fallen {enemy}
  - Secrets of the {location}
  - The Lost {item}
  - Wrath of the {enemy}
  - The {location} Prophecy
  TalkAndKillStep1:
  - Speak to {npc} in the {location} about the growing threat.
  - Consult {npc} about the {enemy} sightings near the {location}.
  TalkAndKillStep2:
  - Slay the {enemy} lurking in the {location}.
  - Hunt down the {enemy} that has taken over the {location}.
  FetchAndDeliverStep1:
  - Retrieve the {item} from deep within the {location}.
  - Find the {item} hidden in the {location}.
  FetchAndDeliverStep2:
  - Deliver the {item} to {npc} in the {location}.
  - Bring the {item} back to {npc} before the {enemy} finds it.
  ExploreAndReportStep1:
  - Explore the {location} beyond the sealed door.
  - Scout the {location} for signs of the {enemy}.
  ExploreAndReportStep2:
  - Report your findings to {npc}.
  - Return to {npc} with news of the {location}.
  EnvironmentalNoteTemplates:
  - 'A crumbling note reads: The {enemy} was last seen near the {location}.'
  - 'Scratched into the wall: Beware the {location}. The {item} lies within.'
  - 'A journal entry: Day 47. The {enemy} grows stronger. We cannot hold the {location}.'
  - 'Faded writing: Whoever finds this, the {item} must not fall into the wrong hands.'
  - 'A warning carved in stone: Turn back. The {location} belongs to the {enemy}
    now.'
